{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"openSUSE-SU-2026:21635-1","published":"2026-08-24T18:56:27Z","modified":"2026-08-27T18:23:12.778277800Z","related":["CVE-2026-25797","CVE-2026-56365","CVE-2026-62343","CVE-2026-62363","CVE-2026-62946","CVE-2026-64685","CVE-2026-66011"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-25797","CVE-2026-56365","CVE-2026-62343","CVE-2026-62363","CVE-2026-62946","CVE-2026-64685","CVE-2026-66011"],"summary":"Security update for ImageMagick","details":"This update for ImageMagick fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-56365: memory leak in the PNG encoder when writing MNG images (bsc#1270004).\n- CVE-2026-62343: heap buffer overwrite in morphology operation when an invalid kernel is provided (bsc#1272575).\n- CVE-2026-62363: heap buffer overwrite in fx operation when processing a crafted argument (bsc#1272582).\n- CVE-2026-62946: integer overflow in JNX decoder leading to heap buffer overwrite when extremely large files are\n  processed on 32-bit builds (bsc#1272580).\n- CVE-2026-66011: memory leak in the magick command-line interface when invalid options are provided (bsc#1272577).\n- CVE-2026-64685: heap buffer overread in BGR decoder due to missing end-of-file check (bsc#1272953).\n- Code injection in HTML encoder due to incomplete fix of CVE-2026-25797 (bsc#1272579).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ImageMagick","ecosystem":"openSUSE:Leap 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/opensuse/ImageMagick&distro=openSUSE%20Leap%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"ImageMagick":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-config-7-SUSE":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-config-7-upstream-limited":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-config-7-upstream-open":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-config-7-upstream-secure":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-config-7-upstream-websafe":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-devel":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-doc":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","ImageMagick-extra":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","libMagick++-7_Q16HDRI5":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","libMagick++-devel":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","libMagickCore-7_Q16HDRI10":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","libMagickWand-7_Q16HDRI10":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1","perl-PerlMagick":"7.1.2.0-160000.14.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/openSUSE-SU-2026:21635-1.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1270004"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272575"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272577"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272579"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272580"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272582"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1272953"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-25797"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-56365"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-62343"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-62363"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-62946"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-64685"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-66011"}]}